  "notes": "{叱責|しっせき} is a formal word combining {叱|しか}る (to scold) and {責|せ}める (to blame/criticize), emphasizing both the scolding and criticism aspects.\n\nUsage:\n- {叱責|しっせき}する (to reprimand, scold)\n- {叱責|しっせき}を{受|う}ける (to be reprimanded)\n- {叱責|しっせき}を{浴|あ}びる (to be subjected to reprimand)\n\nCompared to similar words:\n- {叱|しか}る: to scold (general, informal)\n- {叱責|しっせき}: to reprimand (formal, often workplace)\n- {譴責|けんせき}: censure (very formal, official)\n- {戒|いまし}める: to admonish, warn\n\nRelated words:\n- {説教|せっきょう}する: to lecture, preach\n- {小言|こごと}を{言|い}う: to nag, grumble\n- {怒鳴|どな}る: to yell at",
